oh-my-pi (MIT)
https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi

The following material was adapted from oh-my-pi for ai-memory's LLM layer:

  - OpenAI-compatible provider base URLs and naming conventions from
    `packages/catalog/src/models.json` and `packages/ai/src/registry/`
    → `crates/ai-memory-llm/src/presets.rs`
  - Design pattern of registry presets over a small set of wire dialects
    (Chat Completions / Responses / Anthropic Messages / Google)
  - xAI SuperGrok OAuth PKCE flow from
    `packages/ai/src/registry/oauth/xai-oauth.ts`
    → `crates/ai-memory-llm/src/xai_oauth.rs` and CLI `auth login xai-oauth`
  - Devin / Cascade Connect-RPC client shape and OAuth from
    `packages/ai/src/providers/devin.ts` and
    `packages/ai/src/registry/oauth/devin.ts` (also adapted via the
    community devin-proxy project)
    → `crates/ai-memory-llm/src/devin.rs` and CLI `auth login devin`
  - OpenAI Responses request/response shapes aligned with
    `packages/ai/src/providers/openai-responses.ts`
    → `crates/ai-memory-llm/src/openai_responses.rs`

ai-memory does not vendor the oh-my-pi agent runtime, TUI, or tool harness.

